{"name":"Malted","hex":"#dbc8c0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"malted","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Processed into malt."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A malted milk; a milkshake with malted milk powder."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/malted"}],"entries":[{"title":"Malting","blocks":[{"text":"Malting is the process of steeping, germinating, and drying grain to convert it into malt. Germination and sprouting involve a number of enzymes to produce the changes from seed to seedling and the malt producer stops this stage of the process when the required enzymes are optimal. Among other things, the enzymes convert starch to sugars such as maltose, maltotriose and maltodextrines."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Highland_park_malting_floor.jpg/330px-Highland_park_malting_floor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malting","wikidata":"Q4395224"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Caramel_malt.JPG/500px-Caramel_malt.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Caramel_malt.JPG/1280px-Caramel_malt.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Caramel_malt.JPG/500px-Caramel_malt.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Caramel malt","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACaramel_malt.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Roasted_malt.JPG/500px-Roasted_malt.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Roasted_malt.JPG/1280px-Roasted_malt.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thum